{"version":1,"content":"<p>萬聖節將至，觀塘海濱活動空間（觀濱）將於10月24日（周六）舉行「ReU Fun Fest 2026」，由日玩到夜，集合潮流市集、團隊競技、音樂及萬聖節特效化妝等活動，參加活動有機會贏取禮物。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.730316+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723897+00:00","content_hash":"5cc3e28501dd656a4798b80c89fede82b66dbcaf665280a4f5bace4e4d224778","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}